cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use swmm5plus-capi in your work, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "swmm5plus-capi: a C interface for the SWMM5+ hydraulic solver"
authors:
  - family-names: Madadi
    given-names: Ehsan
license: GPL-3.0-or-later
repository-code: "https://github.com/ehsanMa86/swmm5plus-capi"
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.23678730
identifiers:
  - type: doi
    value: 10.5281/zenodo.23678730
    description: All versions (concept DOI); resolves to the latest version.
abstract: >-
  swmm5plus-capi builds SWMM5+, the finite-volume dynamic-wave solver for the
  EPA Storm Water Management Model developed by CIMM at the University of Texas
  at Austin, as a shared library with a small, stable C API, so applications
  written in any language can run SWMM5+ models and read their results.
keywords:
  - SWMM5+
  - SWMM
  - stormwater
  - dynamic wave routing
  - finite volume
  - C API
references:
  - type: software
    title: SWMM5+
    authors:
      - name: CIMM, The University of Texas at Austin
    repository-code: "https://github.com/CIMM-ORG/SWMM5plus"
